1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,613
Angstrom Signals has a community alongside:

2
00:00:02,633 --> 00:00:05,505
a live stream of social signals, and chat.

3
00:00:05,965 --> 00:00:08,441
The arrow on the right edge opens it.

4
00:00:08,491 --> 00:00:11,180
Other members' posts are blurred in this video.

5
00:00:11,633 --> 00:00:14,921
The stream collects everyone's takes on assets and markets:

6
00:00:14,941 --> 00:00:19,165
agreeing or disagreeing with the AI's sentiment, with a short comment.

7
00:00:19,652 --> 00:00:23,899
Filter it by positive, negative or mixed, by asset, or by person.

8
00:00:25,858 --> 00:00:27,651
Below it is the chat.

9
00:00:27,701 --> 00:00:31,991
Talk to everyone, to one of your communities, or privately to one person.

10
00:00:32,456 --> 00:00:36,383
Write up to a hundred and sixty characters, add a face, and post.

11
00:00:36,433 --> 00:00:40,274
Keep it friendly: no promoting, and no financial advice.

12
00:00:40,732 --> 00:00:43,528
Pin the panel to keep it open beside the dashboard,

13
00:00:43,548 --> 00:00:45,725
or pop it out into its own window.
